Subject: [PATCH] Preserve bounded constant reads before derivative placement

Honor entry readonly/dereferenceable spans and load ordering in typed AIR.
Prove every intermediate and final address, load extent and alignment before
moving numeric reads and static address paths. Retain guarded storage, nullable,
dynamic, resource-pointer and helper-only reads. Preserve inlined parameter aliases.

